                  "text": "AMS 6346"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Alloy Steel Grade: AISI 4130"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product Forms: Steel Bars Hardened and Tempered | Tensile Strength"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Scope: This specification covers an aircraft-quality, low-alloy steel in the form of heat treated bars 1.50 inches (38.1 mm) and less in diameter or least distance between parallel sides."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product availability:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Alloy Steel Grade AISI 4130 Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-alloy-steel-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: The use of this information should be considered strictly voluntary. Information contained in this page or across the domain, may contain typographical errors and are for reference only. Information presented are purely generalizations and are not a substitution for AMS specifications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: Alloy data sheets are for reference only, not for design purposes."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Chemical Composition"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Fe 97.0%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Cr 1.0%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Mn 0.50%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "C 0.30%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Si 0.25%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Mo 0.20%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "S 0.05%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "P 0.05%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Mechanical Properties"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Tensile Strength: 81.2 – 150 ksi"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Yield Strength: 52.3 – 63.3 ksi"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Elongation: 25.5 – 28.2%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Tensile properties and associated requirements vary due to orientation, section thickness, and engineering requirements."
                }
              ]
